sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant J as Buyer phone (judge) + stage
  participant P as iPhone app (C)
  participant API as mint-api
  participant B as Comparator GPU (B)
  participant DC as Decisions (B)
  participant PR as Price engine (D)
  participant S as Supabase
  J->>API: open deal link, POST /deals/{id}/join (buyer pubkey)
  P->>API: POST /scans {kind: handover, deal_id}
  P->>S: 10 s scan, about 25 frames
  P->>API: POST /deals/{id}/handover
  API->>B: spawn handover(deal_id)
  B->>B: SAM 2 masks
  B->>B: per frame: nearest keyframes, LightGlue inside mask, PnP-RANSAC vs splat depth
  B->>B: render seller splat at each pose, exposure-normalise, DINOv2 + Lab diff
  B->>B: lift changes to 3D, HDBSCAN, region features
  B->>S: regions + wipe pairs
  API->>DC: decide(regions, disclosed listing regions)
  DC-->>API: verdicts with present_before_prob
  API->>PR: adjustment = re-price with new damage
  API->>S: broadcast handover_result
  S-->>J: red new regions beside amber disclosed ones, wipe slider
  API->>S: record_ready (canonical JSON + sha256)
  J->>API: POST /deals/{id}/sign (buyer, tweetnacl)
  P->>API: POST /deals/{id}/sign (seller, CryptoKit)
  API->>S: broadcast sealed
  S-->>J: stamp, QR, verify
